---
interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  keywords?: string;
  path?: string;
  jsonLd?: Record<string, unknown>;
  ogImage?: string;
}
const { title, description, keywords = '', path = '/', jsonLd } = Astro.props;
const siteName = '계산기허브';
const fullTitle = `${title} | ${siteName}`;
const VERCEL_BASE = 'https://calculator-hub-songmarcos-projects.vercel.app';
const { ogImage = `${VERCEL_BASE}/images/og-hub.webp` } = Astro.props;
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{fullTitle}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  {keywords && <meta name="keywords" content={keywords} />}
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content={siteName} />
  <meta property="og:title" content={fullTitle} />
  <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
  <meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
  <meta property="og:url" content={`${VERCEL_BASE}${path}`} />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content={ogImage} />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/variable/pretendardvariable-dynamic-subset.min.css" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  {jsonLd && <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonLd)} />}
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🧮</text></svg>" />
  <script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-8849084322770219" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/calculator-hub/"><span class="brand-mark">🧮</span>계산기<span>허브</span></a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="/calculator-hub/salary/">연봉 실수령액</a>
        <a href="/calculator-hub/severance/">퇴직금</a>
        <a href="/calculator-hub/monthly-rent/">월세 세액공제</a>
        <a href="/calculator-hub/irp/">IRP 세금비교</a>
        <a href="/calculator-hub/hourly-wage/">주휴 시급</a>
        <a href="/calculator-hub/dsr/">DSR</a>
        <a href="/calculator-hub/welfare/">정부 지원금</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main class="wrap">
    <slot />
    <!-- AdSense 광고 슬롯 (승인 후 활성화): 페이지당 최대 3개 권장
    <ins class="adsbygoogle" data-ad-client="ca-pub-XXXX" data-ad-slot="XXXX"></ins>
    -->
  </main>
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="foot-brand">🧮 계산기허브</p>
      <div class="disclaimer">
        ⚠️ 이 사이트의 모든 계산 결과는 2026년 기준 요율을 적용한 <strong>참고용 추정치</strong>입니다.
        실제 금액은 개인별 공제 항목, 회사 규정, 금융기관 심사 기준에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다.
        중요한 의사결정 전에는 국세청·국민연금공단·고용노동부 등 공식 기관의 계산기나 전문가 상담을 병행하세요.
      </div>
      <p>© 2026 계산기허브. 돈 계산, 쉽게.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
